# Testing and quality

Write a failing test named with the relevant `AC-*` identifier, implement the
minimum passing behavior, and refactor only with the suite green. Use
`wasp compile` for Wasp validation. Do not use a TypeScript-only check as a
substitute. Record failures and skipped checks; never claim unrun evidence.

